# eng_text = " No one can serve two masters , for either he will hate the one , and love the other ; or else he will hold to one , and despise the other . You can't serve both God and Mammon .
# lao_text = “ boo hon mii phuuayd epan khaa song ecoaa baaw song naanyo aid khyy : ekhoaa ca sang naanyo phuu nii eila aip hak naanyo phuu nan ekhoaa ca sadsyy too naanyo phuu nii eila min pamaad naanyo phuu nan phwk ecoaa habays phlaecoaa eila engin kham phom kan koo booaid . ”
